    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Age",
     "texto": [
      "**Câți ani ai?** means «How old are you?». You answer with **am** («I have») and the number. For an age of 20 or more, **de** is used before **ani**: **treizeci de ani**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers and gender",
     "texto": [
      "When counting, you say **unu** and **una** for «one» (masculine and feminine). In front of a noun they are **un** and **o**. The number two has two forms: **doi** with masculine and **două** with feminine."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
